{"id":"n91969-1-7","stage":5,"title":"약물 · 治病的泉水","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91969-1-7-1","ko":"이 물 한 번 마셔 보세요. 몸에 무척 좋은 약물이에요.","zh":"请尝尝这杯水吧。这对身体非常有益的饮品哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"물","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"번","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}},{"text":"마셔","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마셔","audio":"/audio/b94af85d4e3b100cdd33.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}},{"text":"몸에","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸에","audio":"/audio/739a6a34151d32b155c2.mp3"}},{"text":"무척","meaning":"非常，很","explanation":"무척：非常，很。","readings":[{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55175","senseId":"1","lemma":"무척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"약물이에요.","meaning":"治病的泉水","explanation":"약물：治病的泉水；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"약물","audio":"/audio/ca3c11c49fad0a505b6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91969","senseId":"1","lemma":"약물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약물이에요","audio":"/audio/020ed48150d3d8d2e7b9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"9d4e17cb57a7915a","term":"무척","zh":"非常，很","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3","entryId":"55175","definition":"程度深得别的无法与之相比。","pronunciation":["무척"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"ca3c11c49fad0a50","term":"약물","zh":"治病的泉水","audio":"/audio/ca3c11c49fad0a505b6f.mp3","entryId":"91969","definition":"据称喝进去后能治病强身的泉水。","pronunciation":["양물"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b8716c102851bfefd3d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91969-1-7-2","ko":"정말요? 한 모금 마셔 볼게요.","zh":"真的吗？那我喝一小口试试。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말요?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말요","audio":"/audio/590ccbea0714dba09143.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"모금","meaning":"口","explanation":"모금：口。","readings":[{"term":"모금","audio":"/audio/192ef62bf0fd3efb7080.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55751","senseId":"1","lemma":